1. Lesson Generation & Expert Panel

    Given a selected sub-topic from Chapter 5 (e.g., Optimal Choice, Cobb-Douglas, Taxes),
    When I click "Start Lesson",
    Then the system outputs a structured lesson formatted with:
        Direct textbook quotes and citations.
        Explicit perspectives from The Instructor (formal logic), The Pragmatist (real-world application), and The Skeptic (corner solutions & misconceptions).
        A "Check for Understanding" quiz question.

2. KGB Verification Audit Gate

    Given a generated lesson,
    When the backend completes the draft,
    Then a secondary auditor model ("Sheldon") verifies all quotes and facts against chapter5.md before display, showing a "✅ 100% Grounded" status badge in the UI.

3. Interactive Lesson Q&A

    Given an active lesson topic,
    When I type a follow-up question in the chat box and click "Ask Question",
    Then the teaching assistant responds with an answer strictly grounded in Chapter 5 context while preserving chat history.

4. Educational Video Discovery

    Given a selected topic,
    When I click "Find Related Videos",
    Then the application dynamically fetches and displays top matching YouTube video search links for that topic directly below the lesson.
